WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.050
Elements in a group have the same number of outer electrons, so they behave alike.

2
00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:09.125
Lithium: two, one. One outer electron.

3
00:00:11.014 --> 00:00:15.064
Sodium and potassium each have one outer electron too.

4
00:00:18.352 --> 00:00:23.452
Same outer electrons, same group, similar reactions: very reactive metals.

5
00:00:25.436 --> 00:00:29.436
Group seventeen has seven outer electrons, one short of full.
